  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCJP Natl. Programme on Civic &amp; Voter Education and Elections Monitoring for 2009 Elections Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order for Malawi to have free and fair elections in 2009, the electorate should be well informed and the electoral process should be transparent and respect the guiding values and principles for a free, fair and accessible election. CCJP will provide voter education and monitoring of the electoral process.</narrative>
  </description>
